File: src/fit_field.cpp
Function: Field::GetNum
One decode of the test corpus takes about 358.373 ms.
The code below currently runs at 0.879334 of the original SDK's decode time; the best found so far is 0.86632.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    const auto* const p = profile;
    if (p == NULL)
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    const auto idx = profileIndex;
    if (idx >= p->numFields)
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    return p->fields[idx].num;
}
```
